            "description": "Same-project reposition only (x/y, merge-preserves o/h/z/order). Cross-project move is creative.transfer.prepare mode=move (W7 transfer SSOT), so targetProjectId is intentionally not accepted here."
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "W5 A505: duplicate one node inside the same project via FC subgraph-paste path; neo layout = source + (offsetX,offsetY) default (+40,+40). Produces nodeId. Source not in project -> NODE_NOT_IN_PROJECT. Compensation: trash copy.",
            "required": [
              "type",
              "actionId",
              "projectId",
              "nodeId"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "const": "node.duplicate"
              },
              "actionId": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "projectId": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/actionRef"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "nodeId": {
                "oneOf": [
